Unrestricted access to excellent training, research and services;

Prompt, accessible, affordible and compassionate client-centred care:

Professionalism and team work;

Equity in service delivery;

Transparency and accountability;

Prudence in resource management;

High quality staff at all levels and a competitive reward system, and

promoting coaboration with stakeholders.

